0117                             ; Signed compares. Both are "DE < HL" for the right pair: > swaps the two
0117                             ; cells first (XTHL), < doesn't. There is no overflow flag, so the signed
0117                             ; answer is the unsigned borrow of DE - HL, flipped when the signs differ.
0117                             ; SBB A turns a carry into -1 or 0 with no branch.
