013C                             ; "/" ( a b -- q r ): the remainder is on top. Truncates toward zero; r takes
013C                             ; a's sign. Divide |a| by |b|, then q gets the sign of a XOR b and r the sign
013C                             ; of a. Dividing by zero returns two cells of no meaning; the checked build
013C                             ; stops on it.
