03C8                             ; pdec: print HL unsigned, by recursion on HL / 10 (the stack holds digits).
03C8                             ; Uses BC.
03C8   11 0A 00     PDEC:     LXI   D,10   
03CB   CD 13 02               CALL   udiv   ; HL = HL / 10, C = the last digit
